schway-screen 1
screen chatgpt-device-approval
title ChatGPT device approval
description ChatGPT device sign-in lists the address step before the ephemeral code.
variant light-80
size 80x30
cursor 1 1 hidden
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

  ChatGPT device sign-in started


















   Sign in to ChatGPT
   1 Open auth.openai.com/codex/device
   2 Enter ABCD-1234
   ◌ Waiting for approval
